.IX Title "libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance 1"
.TH libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance 1 2026-07-14 libguestfs-1.60.1 "Virtualization Support"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
